Scale Up Infrastructure - www.foobar.com

User flow:
User types https://www.foobar.com
DNS resolves to load balancer IP
Request goes to HAproxy cluster (2 load balancers)
Load balancer forwards request to web server
Web server (Nginx) serves static content or forwards to application server
Application server processes logic
Application server communicates with database
Response returns to user

